1
00:00:05,912 --> 00:00:08,282
(Leonard:)All right, Sheldon, to start our quest...

2
00:00:08,448 --> 00:00:10,818
...you need to open this Christmas gift
I got you.

3
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:12,574
(Sheldon:)A Christmas gift?

4
00:00:12,752 --> 00:00:14,812
(Sheldon:)You know I don't enjoy Christmas.

5
00:00:15,989 --> 00:00:19,289
- What's wrong with Christmas?
- Oh, where to begin?

6
00:00:19,459 --> 00:00:24,299
(Sheldon:)Trees indoors.
Overuse of the words "'tis" and "'twas."

7
00:00:24,464 --> 00:00:27,094
(Sheldon:)And the absurd custom of one stocking.

8
00:00:27,267 --> 00:00:29,797
(Sheldon:)Everyone knows socks belong in pairs.

9
00:00:29,969 --> 00:00:34,029
(Sheldon:)- Who uses one sock?
- A pirate with a peg leg. Heh.

10
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:36,437
(Sheldon:)Actually, that helps. Thank you.

11
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:39,480
(Leonard:)Would you just look inside?

12
00:00:40,513 --> 00:00:43,783
Oh, a scroll! I like scrolls.

13
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:47,650
They're my third-favorite system
of transmitting the written word.

14
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,350
(Sheldon:)After stone tablets and skywriting.

15
00:00:51,791 --> 00:00:55,891
"You have all been summoned to join
a thrilling Dungeons & Dragons adventure.

16
00:00:56,062 --> 00:00:59,522
(Sheldon:)Your quest begins in a secret
northern village of elves...

17
00:00:59,699 --> 00:01:01,099
...who have all been massacred."

